  const saveMarketSnapshot=useCallback(async()=>{if(!active||!priced||!snapshotCanonical||!adminKey)return;setSnapshotMessage(null);try{const response=await fetch("/api/odds-vault",{method:"POST",headers:{"content-type":"application/json","x-admin-key":adminKey},body:JSON.stringify({gameId:active.id,gameDate:date,startsAt:active.startsAt,awayTeam:active.away.name,homeTeam:active.home.name,...snapshotCanonical,selectedOdds:Number(marketPrice),oppositeOdds:Number(oppositePrice),sportsbook})});const payload=await response.json() as {error?:string};if(!response.ok)throw new Error(payload.error??"Unable to save prices");setSnapshotMessage("Two-sided market snapshot saved.");const vaultResponse=await fetch("/api/odds-vault",{cache:"no-store"});if(vaultResponse.ok)setOddsVault(await vaultResponse.json() as OddsVault);}catch(reason){setSnapshotMessage(reason instanceof Error?reason.message:"Unable to save prices");}},[active,priced,snapshotCanonical,adminKey,date,marketPrice,oppositePrice,sportsbook]);
